---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | TOOLBOXS"
  description="TOOLBOXS Privacy Policy, GDPR & CCPA Compliance, Cookie Usage, and Google AdSense Advertising Partner Disclosures."
  breadcrumbs={[
    { name: 'Home', url: '/' },
    { name: 'Privacy Policy', url: '/privacy-policy' },
  ]}
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 md:py-16 space-y-8 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
    <div class="space-y-3 border-b border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800/80 pb-6">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-950/70 border border-emerald-200/80 dark:border-emerald-800/80 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-extrabold text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-300 shadow-xs">
        <span>🔒 Privacy & Data Compliance</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
        Privacy Policy & Consent Framework
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Last updated: Fiscal Year 2026</p>
    </div>

    <section class="p-6 sm:p-7 bg-white dark:bg-[#0F172A] rounded-3xl border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800/80 shadow-card-light dark:shadow-none space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-base font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">1. Zero-Tracking Financial Computation</h2>
      <p>
        TOOLBOXS is built on a client-side architecture. When you enter income, expense, mortgage, or investment amounts into our calculators, all mathematical computations are executed locally in your browser’s memory. We do not transmit, log, store, or sell your private salary or financial data to any server.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="p-6 sm:p-7 bg-white dark:bg-[#0F172A] rounded-3xl border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800/80 shadow-card-light dark:shadow-none space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-base font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">2. Google AdSense & Third-Party Programmatic Advertising</h2>
      <p>
        We use Google AdSense and affiliated advertising exchange networks to serve advertisements when you visit our website. These third-party vendors use cookies and device identifiers to serve ads based on prior visits to our site and other websites on the internet.
      </p>
      <p>
        Google’s use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to users based on their visit to our sites and/or other sites on the Internet. Users may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 underline font-semibold">Google Ads Settings</a> or <a href="https://www.aboutads.info" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 underline font-semibold">www.aboutads.info</a>.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="p-6 sm:p-7 bg-white dark:bg-[#0F172A] rounded-3xl border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800/80 shadow-card-light dark:shadow-none space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-base font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">3. European Economic Area (EEA), UK & Swiss Users (GDPR Compliance)</h2>
      <p>
        For visitors located in the European Economic Area (EEA), the United Kingdom, and Switzerland, our site employs a Google-certified Consent Management Platform (CMP) integrated with the IAB Europe Transparency and Consent Framework (TCF v2.2) to collect and manage explicit consent for non-essential cookies and personalized ad targeting.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="p-6 sm:p-7 bg-white dark:bg-[#0F172A] rounded-3xl border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800/80 shadow-card-light dark:shadow-none space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-base font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">4. California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA / CPRA) Rights</h2>
      <p>
        Under the CCPA/CPRA, California residents have the right to request information regarding data collection practices and opt out of the sale or sharing of personal information. We do not sell personal data.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="p-6 sm:p-7 bg-white dark:bg-[#0F172A] rounded-3xl border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800/80 shadow-card-light dark:shadow-none space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-base font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">5. Contact Information</h2>
      <p>
        If you have questions or inquiries regarding our privacy practices, please contact us via our <a href="/contact" class="text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 font-bold underline">Contact Page</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
